window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>For 12 long years, I’ve breathed, I’ve bled for only one thing.... </p> <p>Revenge. </p> <p>Four men took something from me, something which can never be replaced. That one night changed the lives of so many and taught me that monsters are real. </p> <p>But I also learned I’m the biggest monster of them all. </p> <p>Nothing and no one will stand in my way of redemption because those men...they’re now three. The fourth - he is the reason they call me Bullseye. They can run, but sooner or later, I’ll find them, just as I did with their friend. They’re already dead...they just don’t know it yet. </p> <p>My plan was simple until I met her. A fierce tiger who had the power to break my heart. Lucky for me...she can’t break what’s already broken. I am no longer a man because the world is a jungle, and we’re all just animals - ready to tear one another apart.</p>"; 
